<title>USA: TENNIS-FRIDAY'S FEATURED MATCHES AT THE U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRIDAY'S FEATURED MATCHES AT THE U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matches scheduled for the featured courts on Friday at the U.S. Open tennis championships at the National Tennis Centre (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Stadium (starting at 11 a.m./1500 GMT)</p>
<p>Men's doubles, final</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge and Mark Woodforde (Australia) v 8-Jacco Eltingh and Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
<p>Women's singles, semifinals</p>
<p>2-Monica Seles (U.S.) v 4-Conchita Martinez (Spain)</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) v 16-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)</p>
